		{"id":"a1c8768b1fcf5618","type":"file","file":"99. attachments/BLUE_PRINCE_Gjz9lCzg7G.mp4","x":-1820,"y":-147,"width":400,"height":225},
		{
			"id":"62c69b0277232f67",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Room Info\n\nThis room is always fixed on the grid.\n\nThis room is surrounded by locked doors that need to be opened through levers that are on certain rooms.\n- [[Secret Garden.canvas|Secret Garden]] - West and East Doors\n- [[Greenhouse.canvas|Greenhouse]] - South Door\n- [[Great Hall.canvas|Great Hall]] - East Door\n- [[Basement.canvas|Basement]] - Through Inner Sanctum opens the Door to Room 46\n- [[Throne Room.canvas|Throne Room]] - Opens the Door to Room 46\n- [[Weight Room.canvas|Weight Room]] - South Door\n- [[Mechanarium.canvas|Mechanarium]] - West Door\n\nOpened doors reset at the end of the run.\n\nThis room also connects to the [[046 - Room 46.canvas|Room 46]], you need to reach the [[Inner Sanctum.canvas|Inner Sanctum]] to be able to open it.\n\nIf you reach this room, you can get a Basement Key item that will stay with you for the run, this can be used to open some special doors available in the house.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1840,
			"y":-1420,
			"width":620,
			"height":640
		},
		{"id":"8857a94cb5cdb898","type":"file","file":"99. attachments/BLUE_PRINCE_2KRxJG9QMX.png","x":-820,"y":-1740,"width":996,"height":560},
